    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect cards, build decks, and battle fierce opponents in Top Check, a chess inspired rogue-like deck builder and online collectable card game.\u00a0 Demonstrate your deck building prowess in the <strong>rogue-like</strong> Challenge Run game mode.\u00a0 Or clash with adversaries <strong>online</strong> using your favorite constructed deck.\u00a0 With a plethora of new pieces and unique abilities, only the best strategists will emerge victorious. Do you have what it takes to reach the top?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rich tactical combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Constructed deckbuilding</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tutorial to guide you as a new player</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A 1v1  AI Battle mode to test new decks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dedicated rogue-like game mode with deckbuilding</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online PvP with MMR-based matchmaking</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tons of new pieces and unique abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cosmetic options to personalize your in-game experience</p></li></ul>",
